sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor O as Operator
    participant R as CampaignRunner
    participant S as RunStore
    participant G as GitHubClient
    participant P as Reviewer SaaS
    participant C as ReviewCollector
    participant A as ReviewerAdapter

    O->>R: Run with manifest and run_id
    R->>S: Freeze the batch and create the attempt
    R->>S: Record PR creation intent
    R->>G: Push the authorized branch and open a PR
    G-->>R: PR ID, URL, base, and head
    R->>S: Attach the PR and verify the SHAs

    alt Automatic triggering configured
        G-->>P: PR opened in authorized repository
    else Manual trigger
        O->>G: Trigger the review for this provider
        O->>R: Attach trigger evidence
        R->>S: Record the verified trigger
    end

    loop Until completion or the fixed deadline
        R->>C: Read PR observations
        C->>G: Page through reviews, comments, and checks
        P-->>G: Publish reviewer output
        G-->>C: GitHub objects and metadata
        C->>A: Interpret identity, grouping, and completion
        A-->>C: Normalized observation and capture status
        C->>S: Archive messages and provenance
    end

    alt Completion verified and settling window elapsed
        R->>S: Freeze first review and mark completed
    else Quota, failure, or deadline
        R->>S: Save status and reason
    end
    R-->>O: Final status or required action
